+## Failure semantics
+
+A throw from `beforeSession` reaches `onError`, then `afterSession`, before the original error reaches the caller; no later turn stage starts, so `afterSession` may assume only that `beforeSession` was entered, not that it completed or allocated anything ([validated by: reports and cleans up a beforeSession failure before rejecting with it](../../src/orchestration/beforeSessionFailure.acceptance.test.ts#L14)).
+
